ebをされているのを知り、是非とも私自身のイラストをご執筆頂きたくリクエストを遅らせていただきました。\n（Twitter等にて原〇やF〇Oイラストをよく拝見しておりました）\n\n【使用用途】\nYouTubeのサムネイルなど\nTwitter等のSNS投稿\n\n【イメージ要望】\n構図や表情などは全てお任せいたします。\n背景がございましたら、キャラクターとのレイヤー分け、あるいは透過データをいただけますと幸いです。\n\n【希望納品形式】\nPNG or PSD\n\n【キャラクター】\n歌とアイドルが大好きな錬金術師\n\n\nひなの様の描かれるイラストの雰囲気がが大好きなので、細かい部分はお任せいたします。\nまた、服装も下記に参考資料として普段の服装を載せておりますが、ひなの様にお任せいたします。\n\n\n大変お忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご検討いただけますと幸いです。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n\n▼Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/Ayashiro_Konoe\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1jfNtJPNprIFxp11v_6qDiODd1ErBLQIo/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takotakoone/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2261230, "client_id": 544969, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd102a69/uploads/origins/20f94f77-6cc0-4ca0-854f-bed11bc28b36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90bfedb925e06d195ed8b3803480d6f4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd102a69/uploads/origins/20f94f77-6cc0-4ca0-854f-bed11bc28b36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90bfedb925e06d195ed8b3803480d6f4, https://si.imgix.net/fd102a69/uploads/origins/20f94f77-6cc0-4ca0-854f-bed11bc28b36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b07e99f1ea2d259001ff07fd87520951 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd102a69/uploads/origins/20f94f77-6cc0-4ca0-854f-bed11bc28b36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2da4557f416653a03872d1c74be6d989 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd102a69/uploads/origins/20f94f77-6cc0-4ca0-854f-bed11bc28b36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba9b384ae84531e3f7d8b3cc481a47f6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd102a69/uploads/origins/20f94f77-6cc0-4ca0-854f-bed11bc28b36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba9b384ae84531e3f7d8b3cc481a47f6, https://si.imgix.net/fd102a69/uploads/origins/20f94f77-6cc0-4ca0-854f-bed11bc28b36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e0bfb56f219b88b05593941146b9fd5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd102a69/uploads/origins/20f94f77-6cc0-4ca0-854f-bed11bc28b36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=902623e86744f97904bc19822e178967 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really like your works. May I request an illustration for my original characters, if possible? They are a couple. The pose is up to you.\n\nThe girl is active and mischievous, with a slightly darker color on the ears and the top of the tail.\nThe male is an adult elf with a cold personality and short elf ears. He is strong and reliable. He does not show his emotions very much, but their relationship is very good. He always took care of her and he generally indulges her. His hair is a gradation of white to light blue. There is no need to draw armor or weapons.\n\nThey are adventures. There are a few costume designs, feel free to choose the one you like between image \"衣装01\"/03/04/05! \nIf you choose to draw \"衣装04\", you may simplify the patterns.\n\"衣装05\" is when the girl turns into a child. \n\nIf possible, please separate the signature into a different layer, thanks so much!\nThanks again for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hElIblSGYEBRuWEN8oq0dpdD1Ue327Ix?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takotakoone/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2261230, "client_id": 667554, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/00ca4bd7/uploads/origins/6a422bf1-e264-4e43-b718-a13a3a33074e?b